    {
      "$type": "Models.Core.Folder, Models",
      "ShowInDocs": false,
      "Name": "Sensitivity",
      "ResourceName": null,
      "Children": [
        {
          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
          "Text": "**Sites and soils to simulate**\n\n\n| Site         \t\t|   Soil_SG                               | SMAP Name_SG \t| Coordinates_SG\t        \t\t | Nearest station_RC                   |VCSN#\t|Soil_RC|\n|------------------|-------------------------|--------------------|------------------------------------------------|----------------------|----------|-----------------|-----------------------\n| Kerikeri   |   Kerikeri silt loam   \t| Kerikeri_2a1 or 4a1| -35.182704°, 173.919934°| Kapiro\t | 27019\t | Kaawa_13a.1|\n| Pukekohe***Ψ***   |   Karaka silt loam      \t| Karaka_1a1              | -37.210337°, 174.694626° | Waipipi\t | 21728\t |  Otorohanga_24b.1     | \n| Katikati     |   Katikati sandy loam   \t| Ngak_1a.3\t   | -37.596273°, 175.950706°| Matahui| 29379\t | Ngakura_1a.3| \n| Pukehina***Ψ***    |   Ohanipanea sandy loam   | Turan_8a.1                | -37.815361°, 176.537074°| Pukehina| 30005\t | Turangi_8a.1 |\n| Te Puke***α***    |   Te Puke sandy loam    \t| Ngak_2a.1                | -37.833892°, 176.283924°| Bayly rd\t| 29966\t | Ngakura_2a.1 |\n| Whakatane  |   Rangitikei silt loam  \t| Rangitikei_3a1       | -38.012183°, 177.322731°| Opotiki    | 31120\t | Opotiki_1a.1 |\n| Gisborne    |   Kaiti silt loam       \t| Flax_77f.1                  | -38.605677°, 177.939866° | Whaerengaahika|30639\t| Flaxton_76a.1\t |\n| Whakatu***Ψ***    |   Ngatarawa sandy loam  \t| xxxx                             | -39.60714°, 176.73027°\t| Roys Hill| 28991\t | Ashburton_41a.1 |\n\n\n\n***SG=Steve G; RC=Rogerio***\n\n***Ψ=netted***\n\n***α=not usually irrigated, cv = 'Hayward'***\n",
          "Name": "ReadMe",
