                        {
                          "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                          "Text": "1.   Sheltered - **ALL**\n\n2.   Netted - **LIN/Paengaroa, Pukehina, Waiuku**\n\n3.   Irrigated - **LIN/Paengaroa, OPK/Opotiki, OCR/Pukehina, Katikati, Pukehina, Waiuku**\n",
                          "Name": "ReadOrchardConfiguration",
